sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant H as HTTP API
    participant Q as Query engine
    participant T as Tokenizer
    participant P as Posting lists
    participant B as BM25 scorer

    C->>H: GET /v1/indexes/{index}/search?q=...
    H->>H: Validate query, limit, and cursor
    H->>Q: Search query
    Q->>T: Tokenize normalized query
    T-->>Q: Unique query terms
    Q->>P: Look up (field, term) postings
    P-->>Q: Candidate postings and statistics
    Q->>B: Score candidates with field boosts
    B-->>Q: Deterministic score and ID ordering
    Q-->>H: Page, exact total, and next cursor
    H-->>C: JSON search response
